## Compilation

### Using VCS (Synopsys)

```bash
vcs -sverilog -ntb_opts uvm-1.2 \
    -timescale=1ns/1ps \
    +incdir+./interfaces \
    +incdir+./agents \
    +incdir+./sequences \
    +incdir+./tests \
    +incdir+./env \
    +incdir+./scoreboard \
    -f filelist.f \
    -o simv
```

### Using Questa (Mentor Graphics)

```bash
vlog -sv -mfcu \
    +incdir+./interfaces \
    +incdir+./agents \
    +incdir+./sequences \
    +incdir+./tests \
    +incdir+./env \
    +incdir+./scoreboard \
    -f filelist.f

vsim -c -do "run -all" tb_top
```

### Using Xcelium (Cadence)

```bash
xrun -sv -uvm \
    +incdir+./interfaces \
    +incdir+./agents \
    +incdir+./sequences \
    +incdir+./tests \
    +incdir+./env \
    +incdir+./scoreboard \
    -f filelist.f
```

